---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Programs — Blue Collar Labs">
  <section class="container-wide pt-20 pb-10">
    <p class="eyebrow">Programs</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold">Build. Teach. Defend.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-steel-300">
      Three interlocking pillars. Each pillar earns revenue that funds subsidized access for tradesmen who can't pay — and donor dollars amplify the ones that already do.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="build" class="container-wide py-12">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pillar 1</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">BUILD — AI tools <em class="text-volt-500 not-italic">for</em> the trades</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-steel-300 max-w-3xl">Tools that solve problems tradespeople actually have. Voice-first, offline-capable, priced for one-truck contractors ($99–$299/mo). Earned revenue funds mission expansion and free-tier access.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Shipped · April 2026</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">Truck Inventory</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Voice-first inventory tracking, low-stock alerts, barcode scanning. 10-contractor pilot live.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-volt-500">Q3 2026</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">AI Estimator</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Bidding + code-lookup assistant. Turn a walk-through into a quote in minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-tradeblue-400">Q4 2026</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">Job-Site Companion</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">Mobile diagnostics and reference. Ask a tough wiring question, get an answer — hands-free.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="teach" class="container-wide py-12">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pillar 2</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">TEACH — Applied AI literacy <em class="text-volt-500 not-italic">with</em> the trades</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-steel-300 max-w-3xl">Curriculum written by tradesmen, delivered to tradesmen. No computer-science prerequisites, no fluff. Free tier for low-income tradespeople funded by grants.</p>
      <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 text-sm text-steel-200">
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">Weekend workshops</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">"AI for Electricians," "AI for Contractors," "AI for Mechanics." One-day, in person or remote.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">AI-Ready Tradesman certificate</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">4-week online program. Practical skills: prompting, automation, doc generation, safety.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">Corporate crew training</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">Contractor-wide rollouts for mid-size shops. Customized to stack and trade.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">Trade-school partnerships</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">Drop-in modules for apprenticeship programs and community colleges.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="defend" class="container-wide py-12">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pillar 3</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">DEFEND — Cybersecurity <em class="text-volt-500 not-italic">from</em> AI threats</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-steel-300 max-w-3xl">Small shops are the easiest targets and the least protected. AI-powered phishing, voice cloning, credential attacks — we audit, monitor, and train against them.</p>
      <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm text-steel-200">
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">Threat audit</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">$2k–$5k. End-to-end review. Report + remediation plan.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">Monthly monitoring</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">Ongoing retainer. Incident response on call.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/40 p-5">
          <strong class="text-white">Crew training</strong><br />
          <span class="text-steel-300">Voice-clone drills, phishing sims, password hygiene.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-16">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volt-500/30 bg-volt-500/5 p-8 md:p-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Want to pilot, enroll, or fund a pillar?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-steel-300 max-w-2xl">We're actively onboarding pilot contractors, workshop cohorts, and catalytic grantmakers.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="/donate" class="btn-secondary">Fund a pillar</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
